        "evidence": ".md:1-4 'The quaternionic basis ... is not an arbitrary choice: it is forced by the structure group G = SU(2)'. .md:55-59: identifies the space-like/time-like split (ω1 | ω2,ω3) with su(2) ≅ u(1) ⊕ m, Cartan 'generated by i'.",
